DESCRIPTION <b>ora_trace_req</b> is the front portion of the concierge system.
<br><br>
<b>ora_trace_req</b> reads a "trigger message" from an earthworm ring, parses
the trigger_message, and creates snippet requests based on each channel-line
in the trigger message.  It then inserts each snippet request into the EW DBMS.
